7,Mangue Records Music & Downloads on Beatport,https://www.beatport.com/label/mangue-records/13267,"Mangue Records · Add to playlist · $2.98 · Love is true · Fabian Schumann, Black Vel, Annabel Fischer · Mangue Records · Add to playlist · $2.98 · Delicado · Dusk, Black Vel · Mangue Records · Add to playlist · $4.47 · Numanthia · Bunched · Mangue Records ·",Mangue,Unclassified
8,Manguebeat | Aesthetics Wiki | Fandom,https://aesthetics.fandom.com/wiki/Manguebeat,"March 18, 2026 - It fused traditional Pernambucan rhythms like maracatu, coco, and ciranda with contemporary genres such as hip-hop, rock, funk, and electronic music. The movement aimed for a cultural revitalization of Pernambuco by blending traditional and ...",Mangue,Unclassified
9,Manguebeat music | Last.fm,https://www.last.fm/tag/manguebeat,"The mangue bit or mangue beat movement was a cultural movement created circa 1991 in the city of Recife in Northeast Brazil in reaction to the cultural and economical stagnation of the city. The movement largely focuses on music. The movement has its own manifesto, Caranguejos com Cérebro (or ""Crabs with Brains"" in English), written in 1992 by singer Fred 04 and DJ Renato L.",Mangue,Unclassified
